{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bully Ball Brigade is about making or breaking friendships (as any good party game). Compete in simple games, and beat your friends. <strong>Be the Best Bully there ever was.</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301400/extras/Spice.png?t=1743364674\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Make the game as easy or complex as you want, with </strong>roguelike<strong> spice mechanics, and full customisability.</strong>\u00a0<strong>Each round's winner decides the game's pace, by choosing the next spice.\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Challenge yourselves by handpicking the available spices. Skip the spice, if the game is already overwhelming.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301400/extras/Screenshot_2025-03-07_at_16.31.46.png?t=1743364674\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301400/extras/SpiceDemo.gif?t=1743364674\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301400/extras/TugOfWar.png?t=1743364674\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your Big Bully stays in frame the longest, and you win! Defend from the small bullies. Easy right?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301400/extras/ToWDemoForGif.gif?t=1743364674\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301400/extras/HideNSeek.png?t=1743364674\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Jump from gold block to gold block to evade the security guy (Big Bully). The Big Bully who catches the criminals fastest will be victorious.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301400/extras/HideNSeekDemoGif.gif?t=1743364674\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301400/extras/DuckHunt.png?t=1743364674\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Team up with one of your friends (each turn a different friend). The one with the most points at the end of all turns wins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301400/extras/DuckHuntDemoForGif.gif?t=1743364674\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301400/extras/Demo.png?t=1743364674\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Download, Play, and provide feedback! The demo already contains the game modes above, with spices for infinite replay-ability.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Not sure if it's for you here are the requirements:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">a controller for each player</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">a cozy couch</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">1-3 friends</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You don't have a couch? Try playing with Steam Remote Play Together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301400/extras/Wishlist.png?t=1743364674\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If the game caught your attention, help the game development by a\u00a0<strong>wishlist</strong>.\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301400/extras/Discord.png?t=1743364674\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Do you have any <strong>feedback</strong>, <strong>opinion</strong>, or <strong>ask</strong>? Reach out to me at the game's discord.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3301400?t=1743364674","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3301400?t=1743364674","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301400/0f866a1d23d1c17a416f59900058136db927980d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743364674","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301400/0f866a1d23d1c17a416f59900058136db927980d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743364674","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Remote Play on TV","id":43},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3584540,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Feature List</h1><p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2-4 Player Support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3 Mini Games (one is limited to 4 player lobbies)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">29 Spices to change the pace of the game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">19 Configurable game parameters</p></li></ul></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bully Ball Brigade is about making or breaking friendships (as any good party game). Compete in simple games, and beat your friends. <strong>Be the Best Bully there ever was.</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301400/extras/Spice.png?t=1743364674\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Make the game as easy or complex as you want, with </strong>roguelike<strong> spice mechanics, and full customisability.</strong>\u00a0<strong>Each round's winner decides the game's pace, by choosing the next spice.\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Challenge yourselves by handpicking the available spices. Skip the spice, if the game is already overwhelming.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301400/extras/Screenshot_2025-03-07_at_16.31.46.png?t=1743364674\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301400/extras/SpiceDemo.gif?t=1743364674\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301400/extras/TugOfWar.png?t=1743364674\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your Big Bully stays in frame the longest, and you win! Defend from the small bullies. Easy right?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301400/extras/ToWDemoForGif.gif?t=1743364674\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301400/extras/HideNSeek.png?t=1743364674\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Jump from gold block to gold block to evade the security guy (Big Bully). The Big Bully who catches the criminals fastest will be victorious.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301400/extras/HideNSeekDemoGif.gif?t=1743364674\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301400/extras/DuckHunt.png?t=1743364674\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Team up with one of your friends (each turn a different friend). The one with the most points at the end of all turns wins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301400/extras/DuckHuntDemoForGif.gif?t=1743364674\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301400/extras/Demo.png?t=1743364674\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Download, Play, and provide feedback! The demo already contains the game modes above, with spices for infinite replay-ability.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Not sure if it's for you here are the requirements:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">a controller for each player</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">a cozy couch</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">1-3 friends</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You don't have a couch? Try playing with Steam Remote Play Together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301400/extras/Wishlist.png?t=1743364674\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If the game caught your attention, help the game development by a\u00a0<strong>wishlist</strong>.\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301400/extras/Discord.png?t=1743364674\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Do you have any <strong>feedback</strong>, <strong>opinion</strong>, or <strong>ask</strong>? Reach out to me at the game's discord.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Norbo"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_i